      "html": "<p>Wild-collected fishes from the USA are only rarely on offer. Chrosomus erythrogaster is a very pretty minnow. Maximum size for the species is 10-12 cm; the fish currently on offer are 5-7 cm long.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "beforeYouBuy",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/08-carp-like-fishes-2-barbs-minnows-carps-goldfish-etc/chrosomus_erythrogaster_en/",
      "html": "<p>Available in limited numbers only. The fish have code 411043 on the stocklist; the supplier exclusively supplies the wholesale trade.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "maintenance",
      "source": "glaser",
